INT. COUNTY GENERAL - TRAUMA BAY 1 - NIGHT

A white, glaring room. Instruments laid out on a steel tray. Overhead lights, harsh as an interrogation. A bloodied gurney in the center, a patient under a sheet, a monitor beeping like an angry cricket.

DR. HORTENSE ADEYEMI-VANCE (50s, trauma surgeon, gown spotted, cap tied tight) leans over the patient. Across from her, DR. RAMIRO OKONKWO-STRAND (30s, resident, new, a smear of blood on his glasses). Nurse JOSEPHINE "JO" ABERNATHY-BRIGGS (40s, steady hands) preps a syringe. Anesthesiologist DR. TENZIN LHAMO-FISCHER (40s, calm voice, headset) watches the monitor. Orderly CHESTER ODUNSI-WHITE (20s, in over his head) holds a suction wand. And in the doorway, tall and silent, stands ADMINISTRATOR BEATRIX KOWALCZYK-OSEI (60s, pantsuit, clipboard), observing.

HORTENSE
Pressure?

TENZIN
Eighty over forty.

RAMIRO
Falling.

JO
Fluids are wide open.

HORTENSE
Ramiro, retract. Chester, suction.

CHESTER
Which side?

HORTENSE
His left. Your left.

CHESTER
Which one's my left?

JO
The one with the wand.

Ramiro and Chester both reach for the same retractor, collide, and the metal clangs. Hortense stops, looks up.

HORTENSE
Gentlemen.

RAMIRO
Sorry.

CHESTER
My fault.

HORTENSE
It is nobody's fault. Ramiro, you hold. Chester, you suction. Jo, give me a number ten.

JO
Number ten.

She slaps the scalpel into Hortense's hand. The monitor tone climbs, then drops.

TENZIN
Pressure's seventy.

HORTENSE
Come on.

RAMIRO
Is it the spleen?

HORTENSE
It's the spleen, and the liver, and something I haven't found.

TENZIN
Sixty-five.

JO
Hortense.

HORTENSE
I know, I know. Suction!

CHESTER
Suctioning!

BEATRIX
(from the doorway)
Dr. Adeyemi-Vance.

Everyone looks up. Beatrix does not move.

BEATRIX (CONT'D)
The family is asking.

HORTENSE
Tell them I'm busy.

BEATRIX
They want an update.

HORTENSE
Then tell them the update is that I'm busy.

BEATRIX
Doctor--

HORTENSE
(not looking)
Beatrix, if you stand in that door another ten seconds, I will have you scrub in.

Beatrix considers. Straightens her clipboard. Withdraws.

TENZIN
Sixty.

RAMIRO
He's going.

HORTENSE
He's not going.

JO
Clamp.

HORTENSE
Clamp.

She seizes it, sets it, her hand disappearing into the red. A hush. The monitor holds a long, steady, ragged tone.

TENZIN
Pressure's coming up.

JO
Sixty-five.

CHESTER
(whispering)
Is that good?

HORTENSE
That is very good.

TENZIN
Seventy.

RAMIRO
(exhaling)
Seventy-five.

HORTENSE
(softly)
There you are.

Ramiro sags against the tray. Chester, relieved, nearly drops the wand. Jo reaches out and steadies it. Hortense straightens, shoulders aching, and tilts her head at the ceiling light.

HORTENSE (CONT'D)
Everyone. Take a breath.

They do. All of them. Together. Then Hortense bends over the patient again.

HORTENSE (CONT'D)
Now let's finish.
